              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crossbowmen have a hand weapon, light armour and crossbow. Light Infantry. May have shields (+1). There may not be more units of crossbowmen than there are units of noble cavalry and military orders combined.</characteristic>
