              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Militia Crossbowmen have a hand weapon and crossbow. Light Infantry. May have light armour (+2) and shield (+1). There may not be more units of militia crossbowmen than there are units of spearmen in the army.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
